I'm Serhii — a software engineer based in Ukraine. I build products for the web and write about the craft of doing so.

This blog is where I think out loud: about software engineering, the tools I use, photography as a practice, and what I'm slowly learning along the way. Posts arrive on a personal cadence — no schedule, no quota.

## What I work on

Mostly full-stack web: TypeScript, React, Node, and increasingly the Cloudflare platform. I care about performance, simplicity, and making things that last.

## Contact

The best way to reach me is by replying to any newsletter email, or finding me on GitHub.
